    "steps": [
      "Season the shrimp with salt and pepper. Sear in the olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat for 1–2 minutes per side, then set aside.",
      "Melt the butter in the same pan, add the garlic and orzo, and toast for 2 minutes.",
      "Pour in the broth, bring to a simmer and cook for 10–12 minutes, stirring often, until the orzo is tender and creamy.",
